ent-ClothingHeadHatUshankaMedical = medical ushanka
  .desc = A white Ushanka with a cross on the side. The doctor wearing this will take care of you... eventually...

ent-ClothingHeadHatUshankaChemist = chemist's ushanka
  .desc = A striped blue, white and orange Ushanka. It's survived many an explosion...

ent-ClothingHeadHatUshankaCMO = chief medical officer's ushanka
  .desc = A turquoise ushanka with a cross on the side. Whoever is wearing this hat will nurse you back to health quickly.

ent-ClothingHeadHatUshankaBrigmed = brigmed's ushanka
  .desc = A red and black striped Ushanka with a cross on the side. For security officers with a background in medicine.

ent-ClothingHeadHatUshankaParamedic = paramed's ushanka
  .desc = A medical ushanka with an inverted color scheme, given to those who can whisk the dead and dying to medical.

ent-ClothingHeadHatUshankaVirologist = virologist's ushanka
  .desc = A medical Ushanka with green stripes and a green cross. Ready to deal with any kind of viruses.
